"New inquiry via the website:\n"
"\n"
"Name: {{name}}\n"
"Email: {{email}}\n"
"Phone: {{phone}}\n"
"Period: {{date_from}} to {{date_to}}\n"
"\n"
"Requested equipment:\n"
"{{items}}\n"
"\n"
"Message:\n"
"{{message}}\n"
"\n"
"→ Manage: {{admin_url}}"
